  "question": {
    "text": "The number of turns of the coil of a moving coil galvanometer is increased in order to increase current sensitivity by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The percentage change in voltage sensitivity of the galvanometer will be :",
