  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Current sensitivity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> Voltage sensitivity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p>If current sensitivity is made <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> times, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> also increase <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> times.</p><p>Hence, voltage sensitivity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mtext>&#160;current sensitivity&#160;</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math> no change.</p>",
